    <preface>
      <p>Primary Industries Research and Development Amendment Act 2018</p>
      <p>No. 79, 2018</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Primary Industries Research and Development Act 1989</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Amendments	3</p>
      <p>Primary Industries Research and Development Act 1989	3</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Primary Industries Research and Development Act 1989</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to 24 August 2018</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
      </formula>
    </preface>
    <body>
      <section eId="sec-1">
        <num>1</num>
        <heading>Short title</heading>
        <content>
          <p>		This Act is the <i>Primary Industries Research and Development Amendment Act 201</i><i>8</i>.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-2">
        <num>2</num>
        <heading>Commencement</heading>
        <subsection eId="sec-2__subsec-1">
          <num>1</num>
          <content>
            <p>Each provision of this Act specified in column 1 of the table commences, or is taken to have commenced, in accordance with column 2 of the table. Any other statement in column 2 has effect according to its terms.</p>
          </content>
          <table>
            <tr>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Column 1</td>
              <td>Column 2</td>
              <td>Column 3</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Provisions</td>
              <td>Commencement</td>
              <td>Date/Details</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>1.  The whole of this Act</td>
              <td>The day after this Act receives the Royal Assent.</td>
              <td>25 August 2018</td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-1" marker="1">
            <content>
              <p>Note:	This table relates only to the provisions of this Act as originally enacted. It will not be amended to deal with any later amendments of this Act.</p>
            </content>
          </authorialNote>
        </subsection>
        <subsection eId="sec-2__subsec-2">
          <num>2</num>
          <content>
            <p>Any information in column 3 of the table is not part of this Act. Information may be inserted in this column, or information in it may be edited, in any published version of this Act.</p>
          </content>
        </subsection>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-3">
        <num>3</num>
        <heading>Schedules</heading>
        <content>
          <p>Legislation that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
    </body>
    <attachments>
      <attachment>
        <hcontainer name="schedule" eId="schedule-1">
          <num>1</num>
          <heading>Amendments</heading>
          <hcontainer name="amendedAct" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1">
            <heading>Primary Industries Research and Development Act 1989</heading>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1">
              <num>1</num>
              <heading>Subsection 4(1) (at the end of the definition of marketing activities)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add “or an activity incidental to such marketing, advertising or promotion”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2">
              <num>2</num>
              <heading>After paragraph 11(ea)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1__para-eb">
                  <num>eb</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>if a person makes a gift, grant, bequest or devise to the Corporation for the purpose of the Corporation carrying out marketing activities for the benefit of the primary industry or class of primary industries in respect of which the Corporation was established—to use the gift, grant, bequest or devise to carry out those marketing activities; and</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3">
              <num>3</num>
              <heading>Paragraph 13(1)(b)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Repeal the paragraph, substitute:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3__qstr-1__para-b">
                  <num>b</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>marketing activities as mentioned in paragraph 11(ea) or (eb).</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4">
              <num>4</num>
              <heading>Paragraph 14(1)(b)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Repeal the paragraph, substitute:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4__qstr-1__para-b">
                  <num>b</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>marketing activities as mentioned in paragraph 11(ea) or (eb).</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5">
              <num>5</num>
              <heading>Subparagraph 28(a)(ia)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Repeal the subparagraph, substitute:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1__para-ia">
                  <num>ia</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>the marketing activities that it coordinated or funded, wholly or partly, during the period; and</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-6">
              <num>6</num>
              <heading>At the end of section 28</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-6__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-2" marker="2">
                  <content>
                    <p>Note:	For subparagraph (a)(ia), an R&amp;D Corporation is permitted to carry out marketing activities as mentioned in paragraphs 11(ea) and (eb).</p>
                  </content>
                </authorialNote>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-7">
              <num>7</num>
              <heading>After subsection 33(1)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-7__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-7__qstr-1__subsec-1A">
                  <num>1A</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>Subsection (1) does not apply to an R&amp;D Corporation’s money to the extent that it includes a gift, grant, bequest or devise of a kind mentioned in paragraph 11(eb).</p>
                  </content>
                  <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-3" marker="3">
                    <content>
                      <p>Note:	Under that paragraph, the R&amp;D Corporation must use the gift, grant, bequest or devise to carry out marketing activities.</p>
                    </content>
                  </authorialNote>
                </subsection>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-8">
              <num>8</num>
              <heading>At the end of section 33A</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-8__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-4" marker="4">
                  <content>
                    <p>Note:	An R&amp;D Corporation must use certain gifts, grants, bequests or devises to carry out marketing activities: see paragraph 11(eb).</p>
                  </content>
                </authorialNote>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-9">
              <num>9</num>
              <heading>Application provisions</heading>
              <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-9__subsec-1">
                <num>1</num>
                <content>
                  <p>(1)	The amendments of sections 13 and 14 of the <i>Primary Industries Research and Development Act 1989</i> made by this Schedule apply in relation to agreements entered into on or after the commencement of this item.</p>
                </content>
              </subsection>
              <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-9__subsec-2">
                <num>2</num>
                <content>
                  <p>(2)	The amendments of <ref href="#sec-28">section 28</ref> of the <i>Primary Industries Research and Development Act 1989</i> made by this Schedule apply in relation to annual reports prepared on or after the commencement of this item.</p>
                </content>
                <content>
                  <p>[<i>Minister’s second reading speech made in—</i></p>
                  <p><i>House of Representatives on 29 March 2017</i></p>
                  <p><i>Senate on 10 May 2018</i>]</p>
                  <p>(55/17)</p>
                </content>
              </subsection>
            </hcontainer>
          </hcontainer>
        </hcontainer>
      </attachment>
    </attachments>
  </act>
